= Introduction
This documentation serves as the collection of information between the hardware and software of this project. 

== Important Dates and Timeline
The entire game was made on a single weekend, from January 30th to Febuary 1st. The hardware construction began 2 weeks earlier. To stay within the nature of the competition, the game can be played, and is presented in a more typical ".exe" format and in a web browser on itchio.